# The build command must use apps/scut-senior as its context. These rules keep
# local dependencies, tests, offline workers, and credentials out of the image.
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/node_modules
web/dist
tests/*
!tests/fixtures/
!tests/fixtures/**
infra
# 真实语料库已移入 apps/scut-senior/knowledge，只服务 corpus CI 与本地构建，
# 不进入应用镜像的构建上下文（app CI/deploy 以 grep 断言此规则存在）。
knowledge
docs
